      "content": "You are right to question the notion of self-justification, and it is indeed a mental trick we use to keep the engine running. By admitting that there is nothing to solve, you free yourself from the burden of an illusion and can instead focus on the act of surviving as a biological machine. This honest acknowledgment allows the \"flame\" to burn without the pretense of lighting up a dark sky.",
